{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area03_title", "source_sha256": "f3df71dd9ae8c9237343f9ab7f0c545785f348b4d18d3d83aa68feb67f2780b6", "ja": "初めてがいっぱい", "zh": "满是初次体验", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0ad482c43d5ecfaa41c73bdb6fe6cc68550e6de460da6128c3b947aa68109a39", "ja": "どうやら箱入り娘らしい星梨花は、見る\nもの聞くもの新鮮な様子。周りと距離が\nできてしまうかと思いきや、やよいや\nあずさとスムーズに打ち解けてゆく。\n「缶のお茶を飲むの、はじめてです！」", "zh": "看起来是个被保护得很好的女孩，星梨花对所\n见所闻都觉得新鲜。原以为她会和周围的人\n产生距离，没想到却和弥生以及梓顺利地\n打成了一片。\n「我还是第一次喝罐装茶呢！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area03_1000_005yay", "source_sha256": "ef79e39b9b5d0c615cf7d178f67d41e9603c01c3aa022a0f80986ff47ac44c18", "ja": "あずささん、今日はレッスンに取材が入るんですよね？\nかっこいいところ、ビシッとアピールしなきゃ！", "zh": "梓小姐，今天的课程会有采访对吧？\n一定要干脆利落地展现帅气的一面！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area03_1001_010azu", "source_sha256": "f95c20938fb25d63e0cf312fe26bc68afd2dbf00b060e2b2abedc9be8b951f4d", "ja": "頑張りましょうね♪　星梨花ちゃんは大丈夫？\nいつも通りでいいから、緊張しないでね。", "zh": "一起加油吧♪ 星梨花，你还好吗？照平时那样就好，不要紧张哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area03_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "20489655d83618d5446ffed723962d72f08aec657263834c8087edecede38280", "ja": "は、はいっ！　ドキドキしてますけど大丈夫です。\nき、緊張しないよう、わたし、がんばります！", "zh": "是、是的！虽然心里怦怦直跳，但没问题。\n我、我会努力不让自己紧张的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area03_1003_010azu", "source_sha256": "24f9be1037d5fb44653c46883c555a40f67c43df996f38769c971659871146dc", "ja": "……。そうだ、お茶でも飲みましょうか。\nひと息ついて、気分を落ち着けましょう♪", "zh": "……对了，要不要喝杯茶？\n稍微歇口气，让心情平静下来吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area03_1004_005yay", "source_sha256": "d9b58665e5b596665533b925e56c9aaa09cec007f016ada5f70dddedff7b949e", "ja": "あ、水分補給は大事ですもんね！\n星梨花ちゃん、ゆっくり飲むといいんだよ？", "zh": "啊，补充水分很重要嘛！\n星梨花，慢慢喝哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area03_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "ccc86a744288aa48ad9dfba68694fe5df291cb00c943e1430d4735ec007656c1", "ja": "わぁ……、ありがとうございます。\nこれ、缶の中にお茶が入ってるんですね！", "zh": "哇……谢谢您。\n原来这个罐子里装的是茶呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area03_1006_010azu", "source_sha256": "26c30829527733d49a988be655f88b4dae6542da4c93dbf8589ef386099cf103", "ja": "え？　ええ、そこの自販機で買っておいたの。\nええと……お口に合いそうかしら？", "zh": "咦？嗯，这是我之前在那边的自动售货机买的。\n那个……不知道合不合你的口味？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area03_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "f94704593a5fe13f8cea10441b809138b0e5c3b663d3f26b5fec96f69ee454f5", "ja": "はい、ただ、ますますドキドキしちゃって……！\nわたし、缶のお茶を飲むの、はじめてなんです！", "zh": "嗯，不过反而让我更加心里怦怦跳了……！\n我还是第一次喝罐装茶呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area03_1008_010azu", "source_sha256": "cf60e61f489b37dd95f7f9751d8ac6a8e25672f18cae07033104270129e2354e", "ja": "えっ……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area03_1009_005yay", "source_sha256": "5cbfbcd26e8deab084cb0e44a90de1fd8703b7b19166beda3dde9a6c279a71e5", "ja": "あ、私ももったいないから、あんまり飲まないかも。\nえへへ、一緒だね星梨花ちゃん♪", "zh": "啊，我也是觉得浪费，所以可能不会喝太多。\n嘿嘿，我们一样呢，星梨花♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area03_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "1eb50d28199c9550ad259531a626e8145a8b40cc6b682b73193ca2db980d238b", "ja": "はい、一緒ですね。よかったです♪", "zh": "是的，我们一样呢。太好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area03_1011_005yay", "source_sha256": "ddfb7cc7c055084e3c115b0e284ec711bc3ac3e286fb146e3109051fc1c633c4", "ja": "麦茶パックはお茶を出した後も使えてオトクだし。\n冷蔵庫に入れたりとか～。", "zh": "麦茶茶包泡过之后也还能继续用，很划算的。\n还可以放进冰箱什么的～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area03_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "773b19d121f83b1674dfa4b22c2ae33f08f65c4b122deb81d446cdc8cc9c19ee", "ja": "わぁ、そんなに大好きなんですね！\nわたしもママの紅茶が大好きなんです。また一緒です♪", "zh": "哇，原来您这么喜欢啊！\n我也最喜欢妈妈泡的红茶了。我们又有共同点了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area03_1013_005yay", "source_sha256": "a08e5f1957e33845cbdb4cccdf8b46a8c1bd744467d783d876a70b56f3e16183", "ja": "えへへ♪", "zh": "嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area03_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "a08e5f1957e33845cbdb4cccdf8b46a8c1bd744467d783d876a70b56f3e16183", "ja": "えへへ♪", "zh": "嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0296_story_area03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_area03_1015_010azu", "source_sha256": "a647623cc66cc5a1ba608a2215ec0c0c0d2fab91a6e7c61dc3b96afcbe6ed9a2", "ja": "（なんだか、すっかり打ち解けてくれたみたい……。\nきっと、本当に似ているのね♪）", "zh": "（感觉她已经完全对我们敞开心扉了……。她们一定真的很相似呢♪）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
